{"product":{"id":9728668795105,"title":"CEASE & DESIST","body_html":"<p>The Cease &amp; Desist is our deepest-day powder ski: a 124mm directional platform built to surf bottomless snow and smear on command for skiers who want the most surface area we build.</p>\n<p>For 26/27, the Cease &amp; Desist receives a rounder, softer flex for improved float, along with two shape changes built for deep snow. Asymmetrical Tip Taper uses a longer taper on the outside edge and a shorter taper on the inside edge, so the uphill ski smears more easily while the supportive inside edge lets the downhill ski finish the turn. Offset Tip Shape shifts the center of the tip and tail toward the inside edge, maintaining float while increasing taper along the outside edge to help the ski roll, pivot, and smear in deep snow. Reverse Elliptical Sidecut keeps the tip loose and hook-free, while the traditional tail radius still holds an edge on the way to and from the lift. Signature Pow Rocker helps the ski plane early and stay on top, while low camber underfoot keeps it loose and maneuverable when you let it run. A directional mount and supportive tail make it a powder ski you can push, not just ride. This is for skiers who count their season in storm cycles, not days.</p>\n<p>Every Cease &amp; Desist is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a loose, floaty, and durable powder ski designed to take a beating.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:25-07:00","handle":"cease-and-desist","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:31:03-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Billy Goat, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128508129505,"product_id":9728668795105,"title":"181cm","price":"949.00","sku":"27ON3PCD181","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfi